## 🔧 ТЕХНИЧЕСКИЕDETAILS

### Frontend Stack
- **Framework:** React 18 + TypeScript
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS 3
- **UI Components:** shadcn/ui (pre-configured)
- **State:** Zustand
- **Data Fetching:** React Query (TanStack Query)
- **Router:** React Router v6
- **Icons:** Lucide React
- **Charts:** Recharts
- **Animations:** Framer Motion

### Backend Stack
- **Runtime:** Node.js 18+
- **Framework:** Express.js 4
- **APIs:**
  - Google Sheets API (data storage)
  - Dropbox API (file storage)
  - YouTube Data API v3 (metadata)
  - OpenAI API (optional для AI search)

### Package Installation

**Backend:**
```bash
cd server
npm install express cors dotenv googleapis dropbox-v2-api axios
```

**Frontend:**
```bash
cd client
npm install react react-dom typescript @types/react
npm install -D tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer
npm install zustand @tanstack/react-query react-router-dom
npm install lucide-react recharts framer-motion
npx shadcn-ui@latest init
```

